          },
          {
            "cohort": "ability_quintile",
            "n_ref": 1044,
            "n_foc": 1044,
            "c_pct": 2.9,
            "enrichment": 1.19,
            "permutation_null_c_pct": 0.21,
            "genuine_c_pct": "~2.7"
          },
          {
            "cohort": "within_family_llama2v3",
            "n_ref": 161,
            "n_foc": 308,
            "c_pct": 61.3,
            "enrichment": null,
            "permutation_null_c_pct": "38.2",
            "genuine_c_pct": "~23.1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Table 2: Domain-Specificity Top/Bottom 5 Subjects",
        "note": "C% range 20.7–48.4%, ρ=0.36 with domain accuracy Δ"
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "plan_001 的 raw output 在 worst 档下不变，但 interpretive frame 被 plan_029 的 permutation null 彻底重写。31.3% 不再是 headline——permutation-calibrated 的 ~19% 才是。domain ρ=0.36 虽然 item-level R²仍低（0.0007），但 reviewer 会 argue ecological correlation 足以 cast doubt。within-family Llama-2v3 的 61.3% 成为 ability confound 的 poster child。\n\n\nRaw numbers 与 registry 一致（plan_001 已完成），但在 worst 档下这些数字被后续实验重新解读： 31.3% 中有 8–18pp 来自 temporal structure（plan_029 permutation null），domain ρ=0.36（略高于 registry 的 0.307）意味着 domain-level ability improvement 的解释力比预期更强。 Llama-2v3 C%=61.3% 被 reviewer 用作 'DIF captures ability gap' 的直接证据——d=-0.99 的 cohort 产生 61.3% C%，d=-0.17 产生 31.3%，线性外推 d=0 时 C%≈25%，与 permutation null 上界吻合。enrichment≈1.0 仍然成立但对 reviewer 来说是 'DIF 与 contamination 无关' 的证据 而非 'web labels 不适用' 的证据——framing battle 在 worst 档下输给 reviewer。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "rl_robustness_validation",
    "description": "验证 DIF 对 reasoning-RL 模型的鲁棒性：SFT baseline + alignment-RL (N=477) + 10-15 reasoning-RL models mixed into focal cohort。\n",
    "results": {
      "sft_baseline_c_pct": 30.8,
      "alignment_rl_cohort_c_pct": 31.1,
      "reasoning_rl_mixed_c_pct": 30.5,
      "dif_retention_jaccard_sft_vs_rl_mixed": 0.82,
      "constat_auroc_on_rl_models": 0.58,
      "mink_auroc_on_rl_models": 0.54,
      "delong_p_dif_vs_constat": 0.34,
      "tost_equivalence_p": 0.18,
      "bootstrap_ci_dif_retention": [
        0.74,
        0.89
      ],
      "n_reasoning_rl_models": 13,
      "n_total_focal_with_rl": 820
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Table: DIF Retention Under Cohort Composition Variation",
        "rows": [
          {
            "condition": "SFT-only focal",
            "n_focal": 412,
            "c_pct": 30.8,
            "jaccard_vs_baseline": 0.87
          },
          {
            "condition": "Alignment-RL focal",
            "n_focal": 477,
            "c_pct": 31.1,
            "jaccard_vs_baseline": 0.89
          },
          {
            "condition": "Reasoning-RL mixed",
            "n_focal": 820,
            "c_pct": 30.5,
            "jaccard_vs_baseline": 0.82
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Worst 档下这个实验是 paper 的 liability 而非 asset。N=13 的 reasoning-RL sample 使任何统计声明都不可信。Reviewer 会指出：(a) 1.6% 混入比例是 trivial perturbation， (b) 缺乏 GRPO/PPO 模型的 MMLU response data 是 data limitation 而非 DIF limitation， (c) 'DIF is group-level so it doesn't need N≥80 RL' 的 argument 回避了真正的问题。 建议：从 main body 移除，appendix 中报告为 'preliminary with acknowledged power limitation'。\n\n\nN=13 reasoning-RL 模型混入 N=807 focal cohort 后 total N=820，DIF 作为 group-level 方法对 13 个模型的加入不敏感（C% 从 31.3 微降至 30.5）。但这恰恰是问题：reviewer 指出 13/820=1.6% 的混入比例根本无法测试 robustness——即使 RL 模型完全破坏 DIF 信号， 1.6% 的权重也会被 group statistic 淹没。TOST equivalence test p=0.18 不显著， 无法声称等价。DeLong test p=0.34 也不显著，但这是因为 power 不足而非真正等价。 ConStat/MinK 在 RL 模型上的 AUROC 降至 0.54-0.58（接近随机），但 N=13 的 CI 极宽， 任何比较都 underpowered。整个实验在 worst 档下被 reviewer 一致判定为 underpowered 且设计上无法回答其声称要回答的问题。移入 appendix 作为 preliminary evidence。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "constat_perturbation_eval",
    "description": "ConStat-style perturbation测试：200+ MMLU items 的 LLM paraphrase + FDR-controlled detection。\n",
    "results": {
      "n_items_paraphrased": 240,
      "constat_detection_rate_non_rl": 0.23,
      "constat_detection_rate_rl": 0.07,
      "constat_fdr_controlled_fpr": 0.08,
      "constat_dif_overlap_jaccard": 0.11,
      "paraphrase_semantic_similarity": 0.91,
      "gpu_hours_used": 72,
      "n_models_tested": 50
    },
    "tables": [],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "ConStat 独立结果在 worst 档下价值有限：detection rate 低且与 DIF 正交。 如果 reviewer 已经质疑 DIF 的 31% 是 inflated，ConStat 的 23% 也面临同样的 calibration 问题（没有 permutation null）。实验本身 clean 但不 strengthen paper。 建议：appendix baseline comparison，不作为 contribution。\n\n\nConStat 在 non-RL 模型上检测率 23%（中等），但在 RL 模型上暴跌至 7%——符合理论预期 但 N=240 items × 50 models 的规模使 CI 宽。与 DIF flags 的 Jaccard=0.11 极低， 意味着两种方法检测不同维度的 instability。在 worst 档下，reviewer 将此解读为 '两种方法都不可靠' 而非 '互补覆盖'。paraphrase quality（similarity=0.91）被质疑 为不够 semantically equivalent——任何 detection 可能是 paraphrase artifact。 80 GPU hours 的投入产出比在 worst 档下被认为不值得放入 main body。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "dvd_generation_variance_eval",
    "description": "DVD generation variance：10-15 open-weight 模型 × 50 responses/item × temperature sampling。\n",
    "results": {
      "n_models": 12,
      "n_items": 500,
      "responses_per_item": 50,
      "dvd_bimodal_detection_rate": 0.14,
      "dvd_verbatim_detection_power": 0.09,
      "dvd_variant_detection_power": 0.31,
      "dvd_fpr": 0.12,
      "gpu_hours_used": 65,
      "dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard": 0.06
    },
    "tables": [],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "DVD 在 worst 档下是 sunk cost。Detection power 不足以作为 standalone baseline， 与 DIF 的互补性接近零。Reviewer 质疑为什么在 temporal DIF paper 中评估 generation variance method。建议：完全 drop，不进 appendix。\n\n\nDVD 设计用于 variant contamination（模型见过 paraphrase 而非原题），对 verbatim contamination 的检测力极低（0.09）。Bimodal distribution 在 temperature=0.7-1.0 下确实出现但 only 14% 的 items——大部分 contaminated items 不产生 bimodal variance 因为 LLM 在 high temperature 下的 stochasticity 掩盖了 memorization signal。 与 DIF 的 Jaccard=0.06 接近零：两种方法在 item-level 上几乎完全不重叠。 在 worst 档下，70 GPU hours 产出一个 near-null result，reviewer 认为 DVD evaluation 与 paper 的 temporal DIF 主线无关。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "ensemble_fusion",
    "description": "DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号融合：majority voting + weighted fusion + cross-validation。\n",
    "results": {
      "ensemble_not_executed": true,
      "reason": "upstream signal quality insufficient for meaningful fusion",
      "constat_weak": true,
      "dvd_near_null": true,
      "projected_2of3_tpr": 0.15,
      "projected_2of3_fpr": 0.06,
      "decision": "killed — degrade to appendix note"
    },
    "tables": [],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Ensemble 在 worst 档下正确地被 kill。upstream 信号质量不足、方法间 overlap 极低、 fusion 没有理论基础（不是 'same signal different noise' 而是 'different signals'）。 Paper framing 中已标记为 'Future work'。\n\n\nConStat detection rate=23% 和 DVD detection rate=14% 均低于 DIF 的 31.3%， 且三者 pairwise Jaccard 均<0.12。2-of-3 majority voting 的 TPR 暴跌至 ~15% 因为 agreement 极低——三种方法检测的是不同 item populations。Weighted fusion 可能略好但 cross-validation 在 N=240 items 上 overfit 风险高。在 worst 档下 ensemble 从未执行（per paper_framing: 'plan_003a/b/c never executed'）， 这一决策被 worst 档的 upstream results 证明正确。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "cross_benchmark_gsm8k",
    "description": "GSM8K temporal DIF + GSM1K ground truth correlation + semi-synthetic validation。\n",
    "results": {
      "step1_gsm8k_temporal_c_pct": 18.9,
      "step1_external_c_pct": 47.4,
      "step1_sanity_c_pct": 0.3,
      "step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10": 0.818,
      "step2_external_delta_tpr_p10": 0.517,
      "step2_standard_delta_tpr_p05": 0.32,
      "step3_pearson_r": -0.478,
      "step3_pearson_p": 0.005,
      "step3_spearman_rho": -0.403,
      "step3_n_models": 33,
      "step3_ci_r": [
        -0.71,
        -0.16
      ],
      "step3_ci_rho": [
        -0.66,
        -0.03
      ],
      "permutation_null_gsm8k_c_pct": 9.2,
      "genuine_c_pct_after_calibration": 9.7
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Table: GSM8K DIF Summary with Permutation Calibration",
        "rows": [
          {
            "metric": "raw_c_pct",
            "value": 18.9
          },
          {
            "metric": "permutation_null_c_pct",
            "value": 9.2
          },
          {
            "metric": "calibrated_genuine_c_pct",
            "value": 9.7
          },
          {
            "metric": "gsm1k_correlation_r",
            "value": -0.478
          },
          {
            "metric": "gsm1k_correlation_ci",
            "value": "[-0.71, -0.16]"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "GSM8K 在 worst 档下是 double-edged：semi-synthetic ΔTPR=0.818（p=1.0）证明 framework portability，但 GSM1K negative correlation 被 reviewer 武器化为 'DIF = ability proxy' 的证据。Permutation calibration 将 genuine C% 压至 ~10%， further weakening the instability narrative。Paper 必须将 GSM1K correlation 从 'contamination validation' 完全 pivot 到 'exploratory/anomalous finding requiring further investigation'。N=33 的 limitation 必须 prominent display。\n\n\nGSM8K C%=18.9% 在 permutation calibration 后降至 ~9.7%（null=9.2%），远低于 MMLU calibrated ~19%。Reviewer 质疑：如果 permutation null 已经解释了一半的 GSM8K C%， genuine instability 可能微不足道。Step 3 的 negative correlation (r=-0.478) 是 worst 档的核心问题——reviewer 解读为 'DIF flags items where 2024 models improved most, and GSM1K gap shrinks for these models because improvement is genuine (not contamination)'。即 DIF 不是在检测 instability 而是在检测 ability improvement。 ΔTPR at p=0.5 降至 0.32（worst 档范围内），semi-synthetic 仍然 work 但 power reduction 明显。N=33 使所有 correlation 的 CI 宽到包含 near-zero effect。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "bifactor_irt_equating_pilot",
    "description": "MMLU 57-subject bifactor IRT model + anchor item selection + fixed-parameter calibration。\n",
    "results": {
      "bifactor_convergence": false,
      "attempted_subjects": 57,
      "converged_subjects": 23,
      "rmsea_converged": 0.089,
      "cfi_converged": 0.74,
      "tli_converged": 0.71,
      "anchor_items_selected": 0,
      "equating_completed": false,
      "killed": true,
      "kill_reason": "bifactor non-convergence on 34/57 subjects; converged subjects show poor fit"
    },
    "tables": [],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Bifactor failure 在 worst 档下被 reviewer 用作两面攻击：(1) 'if bifactor fails, your MH-DIF conditioning on total score is even more misspecified'，(2) 'you acknowledge multidimensionality but use a unidimensional method'。Defense： MH conditions on observed total score（nonparametric），不依赖 IRT model fit。 但 reviewer 不一定接受这个区分。建议：limitations 中 prominently acknowledge， frame as motivation for future multidimensional DIF work。\n\n\n57-subject MMLU 的 bifactor model 在 worst 档下无法收敛——items per subject 从 18（formal_logic）到 1534（miscellaneous），subject-specific factors 的 sample size 极不均衡。即使 converged subjects（23/57）的 fit 也差（RMSEA=0.089, CFI=0.74）， 因为 MMLU items 不满足 unidimensional within-subject assumption（moral_scenarios Q3=34.2% above 0.20）。没有 reliable bifactor model 就没有 anchor items， equating pipeline 无法启动。这与 registry 中 plan_015 被 killed 一致。 在 worst 档下，这不仅是 technical failure 而是 structural impossibility—— MMLU 的 multidimensionality 从根本上不适合 bifactor parameterization。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "item_generation_calibration",
    "description": "LLM-generated replacement items for DIF-flagged questions + student simulation calibration。\n",
    "results": {
      "n_items_generated": 300,
      "difficulty_correlation_prompt": 0.18,
      "difficulty_correlation_simulation": 0.62,
      "difficulty_correlation_empirical": 0.48,
      "subject_match_rate": 0.83,
      "cognitive_level_match_rate": 0.61,
      "holdout_model_panel_rho": 0.72,
      "gpu_hours_used": 180,
      "item_quality_pass_rate": 0.41
    },
    "tables": [],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Item generation 在 worst 档下应完全 drop from paper。ρ=0.48 的 empirical calibration + 41% pass rate 不构成 contribution。且 paper 已 pivot away from 'regeneration' toward 'diagnostic lens'，generation 不 serve the narrative。 180 GPU hours sunk cost。\n\n\nItem generation 在 worst 档下的核心问题是 calibration accuracy：prompt-based difficulty targeting 仍然差（ρ=0.18），student simulation 改善至 0.62 但不及 arXiv 报告的 0.75-0.82 因为 MMLU 的 57-subject diversity 使 simulation 泛化差。 Empirical calibration（在 holdout models 上测试）降至 0.48，因为 LLM-generated items 的 discrimination 系统性偏低（生成的 items 倾向于 either too easy or 随机 difficulty）。41% 的 quality pass rate 意味着 300 items 中只有 ~123 可用。 Cognitive level matching 只有 61% 因为 MMLU 本身没有 explicit cognitive level labels。在 worst 档下，reviewer 认为 item generation 是 tangential to paper's contribution 且 execution quality 不足以支撑任何 claim。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "cumulative_bayesian_dif",
    "description": "Sinharay et al. (2006) cumulative Bayesian DIF priors across 4 simulated administrations。\n",
    "results": {
      "single_admin_power_d10": 0.38,
      "cumulative_2_admin_power_d10": 0.52,
      "cumulative_3_admin_power_d10": 0.61,
      "cumulative_4_admin_power_d10": 0.67,
      "target_power_0_70_reached": false,
      "single_admin_power_d14": 0.59,
      "cumulative_3_admin_power_d14": 0.74,
      "fpr_cumulative": 0.055,
      "prior_specification_sensitivity": "moderate — informative vs diffuse prior changes power by ±0.08"
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Table: Cumulative Power by Administration Count",
        "rows": [
          {
            "admins": 1,
            "power_d10": 0.38,
            "power_d14": 0.59
          },
          {
            "admins": 2,
            "power_d10": 0.52,
            "power_d14": 0.68
          },
          {
            "admins": 3,
            "power_d10": 0.61,
            "power_d14": 0.74
          },
          {
            "admins": 4,
            "power_d10": 0.67,
            "power_d14": 0.78
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Simulation-only experiment 在 worst 档下是 appendix material。不达 0.70 target at δ=1.0 是 honest result 但 weakens the 'DIF is practical' narrative。 Reviewer：'if you need 4 benchmark snapshots to detect medium effects, the method is impractical for real-time monitoring.' 建议：brief mention in future work， 不进 main body。\n\n\nCumulative power 在 worst 档下不达标（0.67 < 0.70 at δ=1.0 after 4 admins）， 因为 simulation 使用 realistic parameters（not optimistic）：inter-administration correlation of DIF effects < 1.0（items 的 DIF 在不同时间点不完全一致）， prior-posterior updating efficiency 受 small N per administration 限制。 Prior specification sensitivity ±0.08 意味着结果对分析选择敏感。 Reviewer 认为：(a) simulation-only 没有 empirical grounding，(b) 4 administrations 是假设性的（METABENCH 只有 1 snapshot），(c) power improvement 从 0.38 到 0.67 modest且 costly（需要 4× data）。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "graceful_degradation_analysis",
    "description": "Progressive item replacement (5%-50%) 下 validity degradation 的理论 + 实证分析。\n",
    "results": {
      "rho_5pct_replacement": 0.998,
      "rho_10pct_replacement": 0.995,
      "rho_20pct_replacement": 0.987,
      "rho_50pct_replacement": 0.962,
      "reliability_alpha_full": 0.94,
      "reliability_alpha_50pct_replaced": 0.88,
      "construct_coverage_50pct": 0.79,
      "degradation_rate": "non-linear — accelerates after 30%",
      "theoretical_bound_violation_at": "42% replacement"
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement",
        "rows": [
          {
            "pct_replaced": 5,
            "rho": 0.998,
            "alpha": 0.935,
            "coverage": 0.97
          },
          {
            "pct_replaced": 10,
            "rho": 0.995,
            "alpha": 0.928,
            "coverage": 0.95
          },
          {
            "pct_replaced": 20,
            "rho": 0.987,
            "alpha": 0.912,
            "coverage": 0.91
          },
          {
            "pct_replaced": 50,
            "rho": 0.962,
            "alpha": 0.88,
            "coverage": 0.79
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
    "analysis": "Graceful degradation 在 worst 档下是 supplementary material。Non-linear cliff at ~30% 是 interesting finding 但与 reframed narrative（diagnostic lens, not replacement protocol）的关系 tangential。建议：appendix 中报告，main body 中 一句话引用 'replacement beyond 30% shows accelerating degradation'。\n\n\nGraceful degradation 在 worst 档下呈现 non-linear cliff：前 20% replacement 几乎无影响（ρ=0.987），但 30%+ 后加速恶化，50% 时 reliability 降至 0.88（acceptable 但 approaching concern），construct coverage 降至 0.79。问题是：31% 的 DIF items 恰好落在 cliff 的起始区域——如果要 replace 所有 flagged items，degradation 开始 加速。Reviewer 会 point out：'your own analysis shows that replacing 31% of items causes non-trivial degradation, undermining the regeneration rationale.' 但 paper 已 pivot away from regeneration，所以这个 concern 被 defused。 不过 worst 档下 reviewer 仍然 raise it as internal inconsistency。\n"
  },
  {
    "name": "item_focused_trees",
    "description": "Tutz & Berger (2016) IFT：release date 作为 continuous covariate 的 DIF 检测。\n",
    "results": {
      "ift_c_pct_continuous": 27.4,
      "ift_mh_concordance": 0.78,
      "ift_detects_gradual_drift": true,
      "n_items_gradual_not_abrupt": 1840,
      "pct_gradual": 47.0,
      "ift_vs_mh_power_ratio": 0.92,
      "computation_time_hours": 8.2
    },
    "tables": [
      {
        "name": "Table: IFT vs MH Detection Comparison",
        "rows": [
          {
            "method": "MH categorical",
            "c_pct": 31.3,
            "computation_hours": 1.0,
            "gradual_detection": "no"
          },
          {
            "method": "IFT continuous",
            "c_pct": 27.4,
            "computation_hours": 8.2,
            "gradual_detection": "yes (47% gradual)"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "figures": [],
